{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5997754983577827", "organization": {"id": "118627091066481", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "7778145568911617"}]}, "id": "1239816683652672"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "5997754983577827"}]}, "id": "875203143507340"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "5997754983577827", "release_date": 1764871200, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 10}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "29336916649234998"}, "id": "881616209633522"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1793296031, "id": "29324216263838370", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v67", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 35, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "29324232420503421"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "5997754983577827"}, "id": "29324232420503421", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "5997754983577827", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "634517912320521"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "1440430501603882", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1440430504937215_8685936910299894590_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-QHRvJaHbZIQ7kNvwFwQZDF&_nc_oc=AdohwpKQou1vgPcbFz6BcCIlcv8AYe19fvHvuxwF6oRnQuT9qU6iDOdb1xigPZAPuds&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQjvyjYt0j_7nnplBW4kzJJaFM88KL08IXbzD0HH0oEuA&oe=6AEB523F"}]}, "id": "40010413001905604", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["dios", "misiones", "criaturas", "oficios", "simulaci\u00f3n"], "long_description": "# \u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de dios ser\u00e1s?\n\nHow to God es un juego de simulaci\u00f3n divina en el que construir\u00e1s aldeas, criar\u00e1s a una criatura, descubrir\u00e1s la alquimia, luchar\u00e1s contra dioses enemigos, desbloquear\u00e1s nuevos poderes y tomar\u00e1s la decisi\u00f3n definitiva entre el bien y el mal. Por supuesto, no te juzgaremos: solo t\u00fa puedes elegir en How to God.\n{2319360502143905}\n\n# Domina la alquimia\n\u00a1Combina elementos para crear algo nuevo! Por ejemplo: fuego + fuego = \u00a1un gran incendio!\n{1364663129087058}\n\n# Elige a tu criatura\nEntrena a tu poderosa criatura para que haga lo que quieras: patear a los aldeanos, com\u00e9rselos\u2026 o algo bonito como bailar \ud83d\ude02\n{1403984061700148}\n\n# Construye aldeas\n\u00a1Construye cosas como casas, granjas y minas, y descubre planos para crear a\u00fan m\u00e1s!\n{1062815590069249}\n\n# Desbloquea habilidades divinas\nElige diferentes poderes para optimizar tu camino hacia la cima, pero ten cuidado, joven dios: no todos los poderes se pueden desbloquear en una sola partida\n{931285016706244}\n\nEjerce tu poder divino, da forma al mundo con tus decisiones y aprende a ser dios en **How to God**.\n{1440430501603882}", "short_description": "How to God es un juego inmersivo (RV) de simulaci\u00f3n que te permite ponerte en la piel de un dios principiante. Re-construye tus aldeas, educa una criatura \u00fanica, lucha contra deidades rivales y domina los elementos para desbloquear nuevos poderes. \u00bfSer\u00e1s un l\u00edder sabio y ben\u00e9volo o una bestia vengativa y destructora? Solo t\u00fa puedes elegir qu\u00e9 tipo de dios ser en How to God. Elige ahora en Meta Quest 2, 3 y 3S."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "3268314146711258", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828008_3268314153377924_5605896239508267855_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nwW2hSASvdEQ7kNvwF96ElW&_nc_oc=Adpp3uNUtzTOaf3FaiL1BAosM01vYouC6N_VJOmHdtvMyEH6YPLVlLWdIVqMFmyw4Qc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ_TpXQDSonTwv1G5huBvhj_CPP-1OaAsFiXYG3aBBskQ&oe=6AEB31FD"}]}, "id": "29408727638763229", "locale": "en_GB", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["creature", "quests", "crafting", "simulation", "building"], "long_description": "# What Kind of God Will You Be?\n\n**How to God** is a god simulation game where you\u2019ll build villages, raise a creature, discover alchemy, battle enemy gods, unlock new powers, and make the ultimate choice between good and evil. No judgement from us, of course - only you can choose How to God.\n{2926680264363971}\n\n# Harness Alchemy\nCombine elements to make something new! Like fire + fire = big fire!\n{1997608174271935}\n\n# Choose your creature\nTrain your creature to kick, eat, shake, dance, and more!\n{1761065595216944}\n\n# Construct villages\nBuild homes, farms, mines and discover blueprints.\n{1818565439586701}\n\n# Unlock godly abilities\nChoose different powers to min max your way to the top, but beware - not all powers can be unlocked in a single play through!\n{1394575526203040}\n\nWield your godly might, shape the world with your choices, and learn **How to God**.\n{3268314146711258}", "short_description": "How to God is an immersive VR god simulation game allowing you to step into the divine sandals of a new god, growing in power as you progress. Build up your villages, raise a unique creature, battle rival deities and command the elements to unlock new powers. Will you be a wise and benevolent leader, or a vengeful beast of destruction? Only you can choose How To God. Make your choice now on Meta Quest 2, 3, and 3S."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "1810520360149458", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1810520363482791_7676753977467844889_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Hp7Iy_RR3RAQ7kNvwEa13ry&_nc_oc=AdoSMA6Re5Djeqo3I5uoph86Q0TJaAAPTOiCmZ-VOmgkzBFXS4_UFJOWHcX2I-X0-ok&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRBOuq8zSwdaoQmaqLFftyrYMXaYjYosRYCYvtFeoLRbQ&oe=6AEB315F"}]}, "id": "2646749022426795", "locale": "ja_JP", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["\u795e", "\u30af\u30a8\u30b9\u30c8", "\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc", "\u30af\u30e9\u30d5\u30c8", "\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3"], "long_description": "# \u3069\u3093\u306a\u795e\u306b\u306a\u308b\uff1f\n\n**\u300eHow to God\u300f** \u306f\u3001\u6751\u3092\u7bc9\u304d\u3001\u751f\u304d\u7269\u3092\u80b2\u3066\u3001\u932c\u91d1\u8853\u3092\u89e3\u304d\u660e\u304b\u3057\u3001\u6575\u306e\u795e\u3005\u3068\u6226\u3044\u3001\u65b0\u305f\u306a\u529b\u3092\u89e3\u304d\u653e\u3061\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066\u5584\u3068\u60aa\u306e\u7a76\u6975\u306e\u9078\u629e\u3092\u4e0b\u3059\u795e\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3082\u3061\u308d\u3093\u3001\u79c1\u305f\u3061\u304b\u3089\u5224\u65ad\u3092\u4e0b\u3059\u3053\u3068\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u2015\u2015\u300eHow to God\u300f\u306e\u9053\u3092\u9078\u3076\u306e\u306f\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u3002\n{1379376814316984}\n\n# \u932c\u91d1\u8853\u3092\u99c6\u4f7f\u3057\u3088\u3046\n\n\u8981\u7d20\u3092\u7d44\u307f\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3066\u3001\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u3082\u306e\u3092\u751f\u307f\u51fa\u305d\u3046\uff01\u4f8b\u3048\u3070\u3001\u706b\uff0b\u706b\uff1d\u5927\u706b\u4e8b\uff01\n{1700737597658662}\n\n# \u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc\u3092\u9078\u307c\u3046\n\n\u5f37\u5927\u306a\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30c1\u30e3\u30fc\u3092\u8a13\u7df4\u3057\u3066\u3001\u597d\u304d\u306a\u3088\u3046\u306b\u64cd\u308d\u3046\uff1a\u6751\u4eba\u3092\u8e74\u3063\u305f\u308a\u3001\u6751\u4eba\u3092\u98df\u3079\u305f\u308a\u2026\u2026\u3042\u308b\u3044\u306f\u3001\u30c0\u30f3\u30b9\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306a\u512a\u3057\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3067\u304d\u308b\u3088 \ud83d\ude02\n{1053620007555791}\n\n# \u6751\u3092\u5efa\u8a2d\u3057\u3088\u3046\n\n\u5bb6\u3084\u8fb2\u5834\u3001\u9271\u5c71\u306a\u3069\u3092\u5efa\u3066\u3001\u8a2d\u8a08\u56f3\u3092\u898b\u3064\u3051\u3066\u3055\u3089\u306b\u591a\u304f\u306e\u3082\u306e\u3092\u5efa\u8a2d\u3057\u3088\u3046\uff01\n{2393731057826181}\n\n\n# \u795e\u306e\u3088\u3046\u306a\u80fd\u529b\u3092\u30a2\u30f3\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\n\n\u3055\u307e\u3056\u307e\u306a\u80fd\u529b\u3092\u9078\u3093\u3067\u3001\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u30b9\u30bf\u30a4\u30eb\u306b\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3066\u6700\u5f37\u3092\u76ee\u6307\u305d\u3046\u3002\u305f\u3060\u3057\u3001\u795e\u306e\u5375\u3088\u3001\u6ce8\u610f\u304c\u5fc5\u8981\u3060\u2015\u20151\u3064\u306e\u30bb\u30fc\u30d6\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u3067\u5168\u3066\u306e\u80fd\u529b\u3092\u30a2\u30f3\u30ed\u30c3\u30af\u3067\u304d\u308b\u308f\u3051\u3067\u306f\u306a\u3044\n{1086155473969870}\n\n\u795e\u3005\u306e\u529b\u3092\u632f\u308b\u3044\u9078\u629e\u3067\u4e16\u754c\u3092\u5909\u3048\u3088\u3046 **<<How to God>>** \u3092\u5b66\u3079\u3002\n{1810520360149458}", "short_description": "<<How to God>>\u306f\u6ca1\u5165\u578bVR\u795e\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3002\u521d\u5fc3\u8005\u306e\u795e\u306e\u7acb\u5834\u3067\u4e16\u754c\u3092\u5275\u9020\u3057\u3088\u3046\u3002\u6751\u3092\u5efa\u8a2d\u3057\u3001\u72ec\u81ea\u306e\u751f\u7269\u3092\u80b2\u3066\u3001\u30e9\u30a4\u30d0\u30eb\u795e\u3005\u3068\u6226\u3044\u3001\u5143\u7d20\u3092\u64cd\u3063\u3066\u65b0\u305f\u306a\u529b\u3092\u89e3\u304d\u653e\u3066\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306f\u8ce2\u660e\u3067\u6148\u60b2\u6df1\u3044\u6307\u5c0e\u8005\u3068\u306a\u308b\u304b\u3001\u5fa9\u8b90\u306b\u71c3\u3048\u308b\u7834\u58ca\u306e\u5316\u8eab\u3068\u306a\u308b\u304b\uff1f<<How To God>>\u306e\u9053\u306f\u3042\u306a\u305f\u6b21\u7b2c\u3002Meta Quest 2\u30013\u30013S\u3067\u4eca\u3059\u3050\u9078\u629e\u3092\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "1417176860385517", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1417176867052183_4174741835059134672_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ubUEHgdvg6AQ7kNvwFnpSkk&_nc_oc=AdrVfAgjmichI_LUViFtmJjg2-jyONyxuxY36rgqt8mw_OZSMbEqTQNlKc1HmPtxO6M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQAnkE-BCTnz7AFqUvN3HBhPVDWLJBYYiw0-3otXztJaA&oe=6AEB3A29"}]}, "id": "2161603901121339", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["\uc2e0", "\ud018\uc2a4\ud2b8", "\uc0dd\ubb3c", "\uc81c\uc791", "\uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\uc158"], "long_description": "# \uc5b4\ub5a4 \uc2e0\uc774 \ub420 \uac83\uc778\uac00?\n\n**\u2018How to God\u2019** \uc740 \ub9c8\uc744\uc744 \uac74\uc124\ud558\uace0, \uc0dd\ubb3c\uc744 \ud0a4\uc6b0\uba70, \uc5f0\uae08\uc220\uc744 \ubc1c\uacac\ud558\uace0, \uc801\uc2e0\ub4e4\uacfc \uc2f8\uc6b0\uace0, \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \ub2a5\ub825\uc744 \ud574\uae08\ud558\uba70, \uc120\uacfc \uc545 \uc0ac\uc774\uc5d0\uc11c \uad81\uadf9\uc801\uc778 \uc120\ud0dd\uc744 \ub0b4\ub824\uc57c \ud558\ub294 \uc2e0 \uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\uc158 \uac8c\uc784\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubb3c\ub860 \uc800\ud76c\uac00 \ud310\ub2e8\ud558\uc9c0\ub294 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \u2018How to God\u2019\uc758 \uc120\ud0dd\uc740 \uc624\uc9c1 \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc5d0\uac8c \ub2ec\ub824 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n{1031922036515974}\n\n# \uc5f0\uae08\uc220 \ud65c\uc6a9\ud558\uae30\n\n\uc6d0\uc18c\ub4e4\uc744 \uc870\ud569\ud574 \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \uac83\uc744 \ub9cc\ub4e4\uc5b4 \ubcf4\uc138\uc694! \uc608\ub97c \ub4e4\uc5b4, \ubd88 + \ubd88 = \uac70\ub300\ud55c \ubd88!\n{3017527048639462}\n\n# \uc0dd\ubb3c\uc744 \uc120\ud0dd\ud558\uc138\uc694\n\n\uac15\ub825\ud55c \uc0dd\ubb3c\uc744 \ud6c8\ub828\uc2dc\ucf1c \uc6d0\ud558\ub294 \ub300\ub85c \ud589\ub3d9\ud558\uac8c \ud558\uc138\uc694: \ub9c8\uc744 \uc8fc\ubbfc\uc744 \uac77\uc5b4\ucc28\uac70\ub098, \uba39\uc5b4\uce58\uc6b0\uac70\ub098\u2026 \uc544\ub2c8\uba74 \ucda4\ucd94\ub294 \uac83\ucc98\ub7fc \ucc29\ud55c \ud589\ub3d9\uc744 \uc2dc\ud0ac \uc218\ub3c4 \uc788\uc8e0 \ud83d\ude02\n{3585203621641964}\n\n# \ub9c8\uc744 \uac74\uc124\ud558\uae30\n\n\uc9d1, \ub18d\uc7a5, \uad11\uc0b0 \ub4f1\uc744 \uc9d3\uace0, \uc124\uacc4\ub3c4\ub97c \ubc1c\uacac\ud574 \ub354 \ub9ce\uc740 \uac83\uc744 \ub9cc\ub4e4\uc5b4 \ubcf4\uc138\uc694!\n{28203785065980330}\n\n# \uc2e0\uc801\uc778 \ub2a5\ub825 \ud574\uae08\n\n\ub2e4\uc591\ud55c \ub2a5\ub825\uc744 \uc120\ud0dd\ud574 \ucd5c\uc0c1\uc758 \uc870\ud569\uc744 \ucc3e\uc544 \uc815\uc0c1\uc5d0 \uc624\ub974\uc138\uc694. \ud558\uc9c0\ub9cc \uc2e0\uc758 \ud6c4\uc608\uc5ec, \uc8fc\uc758\ud558\uc138\uc694. \ud558\ub098\uc758 \uc138\uc774\ube0c \ud30c\uc77c\ub85c\ub294 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \ub2a5\ub825\uc744 \ud574\uae08\ud560 \uc218 \uc5c6\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n{1412619610963893}\n\n\uc2e0\uc758 \ud798\uc744 \ud718\ub450\ub974\uace0, \uc120\ud0dd\uc73c\ub85c \uc138\uc0c1\uc744 \ub9cc\ub4e4\uc5b4\uac00\uba70, **<<How to God>>** \ub97c \ubc30\uc6cc\ub77c.\n{1417176860385517}", "short_description": "\u00abHow to God\u00bb\uc740 \ucd08\ubcf4 \uc2e0\uc758 \uc785\uc7a5\uc774 \ub418\uc5b4 \uc2e0\uc758 \uc2e0\ubc1c\uc744 \uc2e0\uc5b4\ubcf4\ub294 \ubab0\uc785\ud615 VR \uc2e0 \uc2dc\ubbac\ub808\uc774\uc158 \uac8c\uc784\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ub9c8\uc744\uc744 \uac74\uc124\ud558\uace0, \ub3c5\ud2b9\ud55c \uc0dd\ubb3c\uc744 \ud0a4\uc6b0\uba70, \ub77c\uc774\ubc8c \uc2e0\ub4e4\uacfc \uc2f8\uc6b0\uace0, \uc6d0\uc18c\ub97c \uc9c0\ubc30\ud558\uc5ec \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \ud798\uc744 \ud574\uae08\ud558\uc138\uc694. \ud604\uba85\ud558\uace0 \uc790\ube44\ub85c\uc6b4 \uc9c0\ub3c4\uc790\uac00 \ub420 \uac83\uc778\uac00, \ubcf5\uc218\uc2ec\uc5d0 \ubd88\ud0c0\ub294 \ud30c\uad34\uc758 \uad34\ubb3c\uc774 \ub420 \uac83\uc778\uac00? \uc624\uc9c1 \ub2f9\uc2e0\ub9cc\uc774 \u00abHow to God\u00bb\uc744 \uc120\ud0dd\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc9c0\uae08 Meta Quest 2, 3, 3S\uc5d0\uc11c \uc120\ud0dd\ud558\uc138\uc694."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "3182276625305505", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_3182276631972171_8018810520676976186_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Tttvddq6TcAQ7kNvwEvNa1F&_nc_oc=AdpLR6jtJZpxZor4TdhZQ0fwU0OeJhPF3koTg9ORU5tdvPJyU-guVI2AnDXWLpLddDA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ5cD9Y5XIla9025AxyHRknxt6E1ambhUQKJapVNolxsw&oe=6AEB530E"}]}, "id": "1754304455678268", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["gott", "quests", "kreaturen", "crafting", "simulation"], "long_description": "# Was f\u00fcr ein Gott wirst du sein?\n\n**How to God** ist eine G\u00f6ttersimulation, in der du D\u00f6rfer errichtest, deine Kreatur gro\u00dfziehst, Alchemie entdeckst, gegen feindliche G\u00f6tter k\u00e4mpfst, neue Kr\u00e4fte freischaltest und dir die ultimative Entscheidung zwischen Gut und B\u00f6se stellst. Wir urteilen nat\u00fcrlich nicht - nur du kannst entscheiden: How to God.\n{1625506262488943}\n\n# Nutze Alchemie\nKombiniere Elemente, um etwas Neues zu erschaffen! Zum Beispiel Feuer + Feuer = gro\u00dfes Feuer!\n{1081301784494187}\n\n# W\u00e4hle deine Kreatur\nTrainiere deine m\u00e4chtige Kreatur, damit sie all das tut, was du willst: Dorfbewohner treten, Dorfbewohner fressen \u2026 oder etwas Nettes wie tanzen \ud83d\ude02\n{2174672563461946}\n\n# Errichte D\u00f6rfer\nBaue Dinge wie H\u00e4user, Farmen, Minen und entdecke Baupl\u00e4ne, um noch mehr zu schaffen!\n{2111590773085071}\n\n# Schalte g\u00f6ttliche F\u00e4higkeiten frei\nW\u00e4hle verschiedene Kr\u00e4fte und optimiere deinen Weg an die Spitze - aber sei auf der Hut, kleiner Gott: Nicht alle Kr\u00e4fte lassen sich in einem einzigen Spielstand freischalten.\n{3006365389712844}\n\nSetze deine g\u00f6ttliche Macht ein, forme die Welt mit deinen Entscheidungen und lerne **\u201cHow to God\u201d**.\n{3182276625305505}", "short_description": "How to God ist ein immersives VR-G\u00f6ttersimulationsspiel, in dem du in die g\u00f6ttlichen Sandalen eines Anf\u00e4ngergottes schl\u00fcpfst. Baue deine D\u00f6rfer auf, ziehe eine einzigartige Kreatur auf, bek\u00e4mpfe rivalisierende Gottheiten und befehlige die Elemente, um neue Kr\u00e4fte freizusetzen. Wirst du ein weiser und g\u00fctiger Anf\u00fchrer oder ein rachs\u00fcchtiges Unget\u00fcm sein? Du entscheidest selbst \u201cHow To God\u201d. Triff deine Wahl jetzt auf Meta Quest 2, 3 und 3S."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "2490149208145360", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823351_2490149211478693_1345172806008059871_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8_dKFEDFfr0Q7kNvwE-c20Q&_nc_oc=AdoxHCi-vRVuh2N2Yrzi2AkKVc6sbIKEaj_6YCHnhGwNfYDc6PiSNR74aOdSGoDvaUc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSQszsXk1CRnP7i2-SEjTJiGmEEQN2zreYUebW4Qe44cw&oe=6AEB6259"}]}, "id": "1590465772397032", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["dieu", "qu\u00eates", "cr\u00e9atures", "artisanat", "simulation"], "long_description": "# Quel genre de dieu serez-vous ?\n\n**How to God** est un jeu de simulation divine dans lequel vous construisez des villages, \u00e9levez votre cr\u00e9ature, d\u00e9couvrez l\u2019alchimie, affrontez des divinit\u00e9s rivales, d\u00e9bloquez de nouveaux pouvoirs, et faites le choix d\u00e9cisif entre le bien et le mal. Aucun jugement de notre part, \u00e7a va de soi - Seulement vous pouvez choisir How to God.\n{1658837619266693}\n\n# Exploitez la puissance de Alchimie\n\nFusionnez les \u00e9l\u00e9ments pour cr\u00e9er quelque chose de nouveau! Tel que feu + feu = grand feu!\n{1588134472847383}\n\n# Choisissez votre cr\u00e9ature\n\nEntra\u00eenez votre puissante cr\u00e9ature pour faire tout ce qu\u2019il vous pla\u00eet: frapper des villageois , manger des villageois\u2026ou, quelque chose de sympa comme une danse \ud83d\ude02\n{1569627737406914}\n\n# B\u00e2tissez des villages\nConstruis des b\u00e2timents comme des maisons, des fermes, des mines et d\u00e9couvre des plans pour en cr\u00e9er encore plus!\n{28099731476362046}\n\n# D\u00e9bloquez des pouvoirs divins\nChoisissez diff\u00e9rents pouvoirs pour optimiser votre progression vers le sommet, mais attention, petit dieu : tous les pouvoirs ne peuvent pas \u00eatre d\u00e9bloqu\u00e9s dans une seule partie.\n{1058669770484965}\n\nFaites preuve de votre puissance divine, fa\u00e7onnez le monde par vos choix et apprenez \u00e0 **\u00abHow to God \u00bb**.\n{2490149208145360}", "short_description": "How to God est un jeu immersif de simulation divine en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle qui vous permet d'endosser le r\u00f4le d'un dieu d\u00e9butant. Construisez vos villages, \u00e9levez une cr\u00e9ature unique, affrontez des divinit\u00e9s rivales et commandez les \u00e9l\u00e9ments pour d\u00e9bloquer de nouveaux pouvoirs. Serez-vous un leader sage et bienveillant, ou une b\u00eate vengeresse et destructrice ? Vous seul pouvez choisir dans How To God. Faites votre choix d\u00e8s maintenant sur Meta Quest 2, 3 et 3S."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Release Art October 26 Portrait 00.png", "id": "2433668727040496", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825305_2433668730373829_5477882806526475989_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qbnxSY_vLb4Q7kNvwHFJF_U&_nc_oc=Adpy2JL_C2nGFtxcoy5ePRowL5ztYjd7QyWiJt2ZtnE3CmgcNzic6Tdixcx3CpRDpQE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRRd_4rKNc_cFH1UwA21A9ohI8JQJ4q7v6ePLWrIx3TZw&oe=6AEB39AF"}, {"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "1838851770862426", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825462_1838851777529092_5805513534878971883_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7UaWNOCwfUkQ7kNvwHNRexd&_nc_oc=AdpIWoVNMbn90mrQTMMqXC6qJClVZZiNaGLse-wVSeVL8zfgDju1SbSR8aX9Wp4WRtQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRYJjsEIDtcG0tDjc6Ax4s7Vr2TfEc7Xb2qCS2tUw73GA&oe=6AEB6373"}, {"file_name": "HtG Release Art October 26 Hero Banner 00.png", "id": "1668458811581641", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1668458814914974_5170301354134904950_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5meSBdFHb-UQ7kNvwGYmmHH&_nc_oc=AdrM2CYsia8oW0R_7sx9xTluJIpJCN1r2I0MlMrJDVif7tAGpr8OK6r-3G94lMq3g9o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQRdalLcsWXWRoB3MEohNbkwEPD_Mq3NjUN3L3knVFuNw&oe=6AEB622F"}, {"file_name": "HtG Release Art October 26 Square 00.png", "id": "1543800657793143", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824700_1543800664459809_4975649477667398518_n.png?_nc_cat=107