UepbxCYQ7kNvwHA77BU&_nc_oc=Adou950dbRD9snpcdtbou9uLxfTEWWlh2vfEAJwdLH9_KCvEXUSdqn6chdvRqAtEu5w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQj9B1_iPJVQ4gtFT7yHiWkBRlD9tEgXtnK4ep4iYBYFw&oe=6AEB3CDA"}, {"file_name": "PDPRelease_03_Floris (1).png", "id": "2231742881098887", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_2231742884432220_7261418027433097899_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uAep96HDVngQ7kNvwEfeSX1&_nc_oc=AdpNdR3p_DxrthccF4c3hKZ1o-i4FZSbBV_qNYUOAYuzdy__pdRXEVUDqKtTzYIPZ18&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTiUo1gos1tJvwJ3Mzp4_8slVFvxFsGLyTpb1tts4d7nA&oe=6AEB5CE4"}, {"file_name": "PDPRelease_04_Floris.png", "id": "1632112168657525", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823905_1632112171990858_6805774836206188157_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z1ZQmWM3rJYQ7kNvwF9_y9q&_nc_oc=AdrbwaFD_DFXZk_jhX9EBU7cpwmzqSftAgeFLgN8kRP_8upioD0-R98sKM3JDtTXUUo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR8jTUs8fNybrEHr7FwOYCkBsJHaBsMvHzNVQtqpYuDmw&oe=6AEB485F"}, {"file_name": "PDPRelease_05_Floris B.png", "id": "1114471697664019", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_1114471700997352_6993492079225046537_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AL51mC02iRcQ7kNvwF4fjhL&_nc_oc=AdqWQj9MDvPrHbkI-aH-J1ZMV8LHnuWzfnOPr1pseG4RcUQjtvQSORJLNpjUkhQbhk8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSxzU5bvMU5wwRpt2Go73vonIJ3BhnyCMmpujpdKceSXA&oe=6AEB5AFC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "HtG Release Art October 26 Landscape 00.png", "id": "1118077857293440", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825575_1118077863960106_9082237555860079550_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TZc09ON6IE8Q7kNvwGYvFpq&_nc_oc=AdoH4vQGQlaREvx3Rs9fhfNyGoyJsPjFc03tHVRjhISaVRKtuwnu8b5UON85W9KnPaQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT_HRh_nt8Dsi0ywKCcKmkOHqziGwiMAkioZ0vhw4BwFQ&oe=6AEB57CA"}, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["creature", "quests", "crafting", "simulation", "building"], "long_description": "# What Kind of God Will You Be?\n\n**How to God** is a god simulation game where you\u2019ll build villages, raise a creature, discover alchemy, battle enemy gods, unlock new powers, and make the ultimate choice between good and evil. No judgement from us, of course - only you can choose How to God.\n{2710262969424052}\n\n# Harness Alchemy\nCombine elements to make something new! Like fire + fire = big fire!\n{1064190926351656}\n\n# Choose your creature\nTrain your mighty creature to do whatever you please: kick villagers, eat villagers\u2026 or, something nice like dance \ud83d\ude02\n{1805193534239505}\n\n# Construct villages\nBuild stuff like homes, farms, mines and discover blueprints to make even more!\n{1046203311364976}\n\n# Unlock godly abilities\nChoose different powers to min max your way to the top, but beware godling - not all powers can be unlocked in a single save.\n{1621013422943899}\n\nWield your godly might, shape the world with your choices, and learn **How to God**.\n{1037328029315321}", "short_description": "How to God is an immersive VR god simulation game allowing you to step into the divine sandals of a new god, growing in power as you progress. Build up your villages, raise a unique creature, battle rival deities and command the elements to unlock new powers. Will you be a wise and benevolent leader, or a vengeful beast of destruction? Only you can choose How To God. Make your choice now on Meta Quest 2, 3, and 3S."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HtG Group Picture October 2026 03-1 (1).png", "id": "1303309515157115", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_1303309525157114_3877608800056738471_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Om01NPGyrRwQ7kNvwHLplo0&_nc_oc=Adp1r3CA5P04kcCC7ItyR1D1p2SjopUsr3d_wSC63rKrVQhM1lM831zbuw6uFhf2jjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ2aYpRFdLxRYreSPWRDsLHcpm98QxxO0l6NhbwnsVLJQ&oe=6AEB4829"}]}, "id": "1127427320096974", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "How to God", "keywords": ["dios", "misiones", "criaturas", "oficios", "simulaci\u00f3n"], "long_description": "# \u00bfQu\u00e9 tipo de dios ser\u00e1s?\n\n**How to God** es un juego de simulaci\u00f3n divina en el que construir\u00e1s aldeas, criar\u00e1s a una criatura, descubrir\u00e1s la alquimia, luchar\u00e1s contra dioses enemigos, desbloquear\u00e1s nuevos poderes y tomar\u00e1s la decisi\u00f3n definitiva entre el bien y el mal. Por supuesto, no te juzgaremos: solo t\u00fa puedes elegir en How to God.\n{1580937150495850}\n\n# Domina la alquimia\n\u00a1Combina elementos para crear algo nuevo! Por ejemplo: fuego + fuego = \u00a1un gran incendio!\n{1595214958724772}\n\n# Elige a tu criatura\nEntrena a tu poderosa criatura para que haga lo que quieras: patear a los aldeanos, com\u00e9rselos\u2026 o algo bonito como bailar \ud83d\ude02\n{1730306058078065}\n\n# Construye aldeas\n\u00a1Construye cosas como casas, granjas y minas, y descubre planos para crear a\u00fan m\u00e1s!\n{1333428491989440}\n\n# Desbloquea habilidades divinas\nElige diferentes poderes para optimizar tu camino hacia la cima, pero ten cuidado, joven dios: no todos los poderes se pueden desbloquear en una sola partida\n{1132844022740556}\n\nEjerce tu poder divino, da forma al mundo con tus decisiones y aprende a ser dios en **How to God**.\n{1303309515157115}", "short_description": "How to God es un juego inmersivo (RV) de simulaci\u00f3n que te permite ponerte en la piel de un dios principiante. Re-construye tus aldeas, educa una criatura \u00fanica, lucha contra deidades rivales y domina los elementos para desbloquear nuevos poderes. \u00bfSer\u00e1s un l\u00edder sabio y ben\u00e9volo o una bestia vengativa y destructora? Solo t\u00fa puedes elegir qu\u00e9 tipo de dios ser en How to God. Elige ahora en Meta Quest 2, 3 y 3S."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.thoughtfish.de/htg-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.thoughtfish.de/htg-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Neem", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/8KhtKdkAxu", "website_url": "https://www.thoughtfish.de/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US", "en_AU", "en_CA", "en_ZA", "en_GB", "de", "de_CH", "fr_BE", "fr_CA", "fr", "ja", "ko", "es_CO", "es_MX", "es_PE", "es_PR", "es", "es_VE"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29324232420503421"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824700_1543800664459809_4975649477667398518_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WAnLcd6l1TUQ7kNvwGQsECO&_nc_oc=AdrzNS1tLPbkdBy1C3mF1_R2syUOaUXzNubRPhRDLtFOEcGXyeiVzHTzVIbXdX_nUsU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTNDTtZMCWjDqHUAO82cuob5tj9a7xVl_6MtFM53IqINQ&oe=6AEB3B94"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "How to God", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category